    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mage at Stake is a fun and exciting roguelite game created by two university students during our final year as part of our research for our bachelor\u2019s thesis. We made this game in just seven weeks, putting all our creativity and hard work into it. We hope you enjoy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422860/extras/7627b48bded05ad845f54c655e653d99.avif?t=1740067546\" data-has-big width=800 height=420 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Made By:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thulfekar Issam Alshreese - Game Programmer and Designer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tom Ellstr\u00f6m Johansson - Game Programmer and Designer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special thanks to  Isac Ala and Alexander Rydgren for the music and Noah Dovholt for the 2d art illustration</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422860/extras/c310f049be0b7ddf9783a59a7f034fb9.avif?t=1740067546\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mage at Stake is a fun and exciting roguelite game created by two university students during our final year as part of our research for our bachelor\u2019s thesis. We made this game in just seven weeks, putting all our creativity and hard work into it. We hope you enjoy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422860/extras/7627b48bded05ad845f54c655e653d99.avif?t=1740067546\" data-has-big width=800 height=420 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Made By:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thulfekar Issam Alshreese - Game Programmer and Designer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tom Ellstr\u00f6m Johansson - Game Programmer and Designer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special thanks to  Isac Ala and Alexander Rydgren for the music and Noah Dovholt for the 2d art illustration</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422860/extras/c310f049be0b7ddf9783a59a7f034fb9.avif?t=1740067546\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Roguelite wizard game, where you play as a wizard fighting off waves of monsters and bosses using powerful magic, gathering helper bats and perks. Each time you play, you\u2019ll face new challenges in different biomes, making you think on your feet and try different strategies to win.",
